 "summary": "Thick-film surface-mount chip resistors in eleven sizes from 0075 (0.3 × 0.15 mm) to 2512 (6.35 × 3.1 mm), in tolerances of ±0.1%, ±0.5%, ±1% and ±5% plus zero-ohm jumpers (±10% and ±20% from 24 MΩ to 100 MΩ in RC0805 and RC1206), with matte tin over nickel terminations. Ratings run from 1/50 W to 2 W at 70 °C, with a double-power grade in several sizes. RC0603FR-07100KL is a 0603, 100 kΩ, ±1%, 1/10 W part on 7-inch paper tape, with a ±100 ppm/°C temperature coefficient.",
